1	/**
2	 * The one spelling of the token line an agent's comment carries.
3	 *
4	 * `post_result_comment` writes it at the end of a run; the metrics report reads it
5	 * back out of the GitHub API, in another process and often days later. That is one
6	 * fact in two places, and the failure is silent in the direction that matters: a
7	 * comma added on the writing side and not the reading side does not raise anything,
8	 * it just stops every token figure from being counted, and the report goes on
9	 * printing a smaller number with no sign that it shrank.
10	 *
11	 * So both sides come from here, and the round trip is tested rather than the regex.
12	 */
13	
14	/** What a run measured, as the writer has it — strings, since it read them out of a log. */
